  "question": {
    "text": "The structure of chloramphenicol given below<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/hhhhdfdf.JPG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 116px;\" /><br />\r<br />\rIf number of chiral carbon atoms in this structure is X and number of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> hybridised carbon atoms is Y. The sum of X + Y is equal to?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/wfffff56.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 103px;\" /><br /><br />It has two chiral C-atoms and <math><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> hybridised C-atoms so X = 2, Y = 7<br /><br />Hence <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
